# Mission: Replace code editor with Monaco Editor (VS Code engine) - pro, professional, identical to VS Code

User direction: "Search for the best code editor online and implement it to make it
more professional and look exactly like VS Code."
Best choice: **Monaco Editor** (`monaco-editor` + `@monaco-editor/react`) — the actual
editor engine that powers VS Code. Delivers the exact VS Code look & feel:
minimap, breadcrumbs, command palette, IntelliSense, multi-cursor, find/replace,
bracket colorization, 10+ languages, dark+/light+ themes.

